        "payload": "tree 643ff681529bbfa8cf87ad06059292e8bf2f429b\nparent bb84dda2fe2b77a6e8609a423d3df22ba50e6e92\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1795517187 +0100\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1795551924 +0100\n\nblockstorage: reject missing data at the lower block\n\nThe genesis undo exception accepts any matching requested flag, so `BLOCK_OPT_WITNESS` can hide missing block data at genesis.\nCheck the lower block for missing requested bits before walking the range, exempting only genesis undo data.\nWhen both endpoints are the same pruned block with only undo data, a request for block data and undo data now returns `false` before reaching the walker assertion.\nAssert the existing `cs_main` requirement on entry so it also covers the early returns.\n",
