      "message": "blockstorage: honor undo-only requests down to genesis\n\nThe old genesis branch rejected undo-only requests because it looked for a matching flag after removing the only requested bit.\nGenesis has already passed the lower block check.\nIf the walk stops at its child because genesis lacks undo data, the whole range is available.\nEvery other lower block has already passed the full mask check, so the walk cannot stop at its child.",
